    - target: {fileID: 8814068479164366629, guid: 60ed96064c5523b46b7a7bd67e36e6d7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Anamorphosis requires the viewer to look at the distorted projection
        of an image/object from a specific point of view, and/or through a certain
        media, in order to distinguish a recognizable image/object. Anamorphic sculptures
        represent 3D deformed objects whose real form can be seen when glimpsed in
        their reflection on a mirror or by looking at them through certain optic
        media.

'
